docs {
  **Bet 1.** Ask anyone in Yaounde for an address and they name a carrefour. `match_type` says how the match was made: `exact_alias` means somebody typed what people actually say. Fuzzy matching runs in the Postgres index with trigrams and unaccent, never in Python.
}
